runtime_text_editor_retained_phase_stability_rustfmt_static_visual_cargo_deferred
Date: 2026-07-04 Asia/Shanghai
Scope: editor retained-host small label horizontal spacing from user crop (`editor base.zui`, `folder-open.svg`).

Problem addressed:
- DengXian selection and 8-bin fallback raster precision were in place, but a runtime shaped origin could still differ by less than the advance tolerance while crossing the final retained 1/8px raster placement bin.
- That made compact editor labels look like individual glyphs shifted left or right even though total run width still matched.

Implementation evidence:
- zircon_editor/src/ui/retained_host/host_contract/paint_text/draw/placement.rs centralizes retained glyph phase binning at 8 bins.
- zircon_editor/src/ui/retained_host/host_contract/paint_text/draw/glyphs.rs consumes RetainedGlyphPlacement from the shared placement owner.
- zircon_editor/src/ui/retained_host/host_contract/paint_text/draw/layout.rs now accepts runtime/shaped positions only when host and shaped origins resolve to the same retained raster bin.
- zircon_editor/src/ui/retained_host/host_contract/paint_text/draw/layout/tests.rs adds runtime_positioned_glyphs_rejects_shaped_positions_that_shift_raster_phase.

Checks run:
- rustfmt --edition 2021 --check zircon_editor/src/ui/retained_host/host_contract/paint_text/draw.rs zircon_editor/src/ui/retained_host/host_contract/paint_text/draw/glyphs.rs zircon_editor/src/ui/retained_host/host_contract/paint_text/draw/glyphs/tests.rs zircon_editor/src/ui/retained_host/host_contract/paint_text/draw/layout.rs zircon_editor/src/ui/retained_host/host_contract/paint_text/draw/layout/tests.rs zircon_editor/src/ui/retained_host/host_contract/paint_text/draw/placement.rs: passed.

Deferred checks:
- Focused Cargo was not started because external cargo/rustc lanes were active in the workspace.

